	j2311862366 [label="trying to be what they want feels so wrong. and even if it didn't? it'd be pointless... i know i'll fail... but not trying? ... lua, the loneliness feels like a crushing weight that makes it so it's hard to get out of bed some days",shape=box,color=blue];
